# localize entries in zone order: NAME<TAB>value (\n \r \t \\ escaped); values are ascii in the zone
EXE_MATCHEND_PARTNER_LEAVE	Your partner left the game. The match has ended
EXE_LSG_DISCONNECTED_SERVERSIDE	Lost connection to the lobby service
EXE_LSG_DS_DISCONNECTED	The game server lost connection to the lobby service
EXE_DS_GETALLPLAYERSDATA_ERROR	The game server encountered an error and exited
PLATFORM_PICK_UP_JUGGERNAUT	Press^3 &&1 ^7to pick up Juggernaut
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG1	Gain XP! You get experience points(XP) for getting kills, completing challenges, and completing matches on Ranked servers.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG2	Level up! As you gain XP, you earn promotions, unlockables, and new challenges.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG3	Customize your weapon! You can add a camouflage pattern or attachment to your weapons in Create-a-class.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG4	Design your own class! Create-a-class lets you choose your weapons and perks, then name the class to your liking.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG5	Use teamwork! If you damage an enemy but someone else gets the kill, you are awarded assist points.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG6	Get hardcore.  Hardcore modes remove your hud and make weapons even more deadly.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG8	Challenges are rewarding.  Weapon challenges unlock attachments and camouflage patterns for use in Create-a-class.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG10	Listen in... You can hear the enemy team's voice chat with the Eavesdrop perk.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG11	Be aware... You can spot enemy explosive devices like claymores and C4 with the Bomb Squad perk.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG13	Combine your air support!  Call in an airstrike in combination with a UAV for a pinpoint accurate carpet bomb.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG14	Chopper down!  Don't be afraid to fire at enemy choppers with your primary weapon.  It may do less damage than a rocket, but it definitely hurts.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG15	Find the enemy!  Calling in a UAV shows enemies on your radar as red dots.  Knowing the enemy position is a big advantage.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG17	Defend your flags!  In the Domination game mode, holding marked objectives gives your team points.  The more objectives you hold, the more points you get.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG18	Watch those corners!  Be careful playing Search and Destroy - when you die you don't respawn.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG19	Escort the bomb!  Protect the bomb carrier in Sabotage.  It takes teamwork to get to the enemy objective.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG20	Call in radar!  You can earn radar for you and your team by getting 3 kills in a row without dying.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG21	Call in an airstrike!  Get 5 kills in a row without dying and you can call in an air strike on the position of your choice.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG22	Call in a chopper!  You can earn helicopter air support by getting 7 kills in a row without dying.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG23	Back to basics... The Old School game modes don't have classes.  Everyone starts with the same weapons and must pick up new weapons and perks in the level.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG24	Pick your shots!  When you fire a weapon WITHOUT a silencer, you appear as a red dot on your enemies' compass.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG25	Get quiet...  Using a silencer doesn't show your shots as a red dot on the enemy compass, but your weapon's range is reduced.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG26	Stealth technology.  Using the UAV Jammer perk will prevent you from showing as a red dot on the enemy compass.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG27	Grenades from a rifle mounted grenade launcher need to travel before they are armed.  They do damage if they hit your enemy, but only explode at a distance.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG28	Create your own game mode!  Start your own server and tweak game mode settings to whatever you like.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG29	Dominate with teamwork!  Domination flags capture faster with multiple teammates capturing together.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG30	Use your knife!  Melee the enemy with your knife for a fast and humiliating kill.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG31	Run faster!  Pressing sprint will allow you to run faster for a short amount of time, but you can't use your weapon.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG32	Hold your breath!  Hold your breath with scoped weapons for increased accuracy.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG33	Throw back grenades!  Look for the grenade throwback icon when a grenade is near you.  You can throw back the enemy's grenades.
PLATFORM_DYK_MSG36	Explosive shortcut!  Double tap the use key to detonate thrown C4 while using another weapon.
PLATFORM_SYSTEM_LINK_CAPS	LAN PARTY
PLATFORM_SYSTEM_LINK_TITLE	LAN PARTY
PLATFORM_PRESS_TO_COPYCAT	Press^3 [{weapnext}] ^7 Steal their class!
PLATFORM_FRIEND_ALREADY_CONNECTED	This friend is already in our game/party
PLATFORM_JOIN_SESSION_PRIVATE	This friend's game or party session is private. You can only join by invitation.
PLATFORM_OFFENSIVE_NO_PANELTY	(You will not be penalized in terms of game completion.)
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG1	Complete Perk challenges to unlock upgraded Perks.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG2	Get Killstreak Rewards by getting consecutive kills without dying.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG3	Use weapon attachments to unlock special weapon attachments.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG4	Some killstreak rewards are controllable but leave you vulnerable on the ground.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG5	Check out all of your Accolades in the Barracks.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG6	Private Matches allow you to play with friends on a LAN or online.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG7	Swap out Frag grenades for Tactical Insertion, Blast Shield, and other equipment.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG8	Deathstreaks give you a boost when things aren't going your way.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG9	Bullets can ricochet off of Riot Shields and kill!
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG10	Edit your Callsign to show off Titles and Emblems you've earned.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG11	Scroll left and right on the Game Summary for more detailed info.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG13	Shutting down mid-game will cause you to lose your Match Bonus.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG14	Care Package is an airdrop that awards a random killstreak reward or ammo.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG15	Tactical Insertion is a flare that marks where your next respawn will be.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG16	Destroy red flares to prevent an enemy Tactical Insertion.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG17	Semtex will stick to your enemy.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG18	Blast Shield increases your resistance to explosions but limits your view.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG19	Even when your Riot Shield is on your back it blocks bullets.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG20	The Heartbeat Sensor attachment detects enemies that are close by.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG21	The Cold-Blooded perk makes you invisible to thermal vision, UAV, and enemy air support.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG24	Crouch with the Riot Shield to protect your feet.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG25	The Painkiller Deathstreak gives you extra protection when you respawn.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG26	Point your Riot Shield directly at the person shooting you for maximum effectiveness.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG27	Sentry Guns can be temporarily disabled by using Flashbangs or Stun Grenades on them.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG28	The Predator Missile lets you control a missile fired from above.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG29	Crouch with the Riot Shield to cover your feet and get maximum protection.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG30	Killstreak Rewards are unlocked in the order you choose.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG31	3rd Person modes allow you to experience tactical gameplay from an over the shoulder perspective.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG32	The default Classes contain items unlocked at later levels, giving you a preview of things to come.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG33	The Scavenger Perk lets you resupply your loadout by taking it from fallen foes.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG34	Steal your killer's loadout during killcam with the Copycat Deathstreak.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG35	The Tactical Knife attachment for Handguns speeds up your melee.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG36	The Bling Perk allows you to have 2 attachments on your primary weapon.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG37	Survive a Final Stand bleedout and you stand back up.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG38	Killstreak Rewards attained from airdrop crates do not count towards your killstreak count.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG39	Akimbo weapons give you more firepower but restrict your ability to aim down the sight.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG40	Your matches are being automatically recorded. You can watch them at the theater menu.
PLATFORM_DYK_IW4_MSG41	Don't want to level up? Check out the unlock stats feature at the barracks menu.
PLATFORM_STEAM_OFFLINE	Must be signed in to Steam in Online mode to play.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG2	You don't have to look at a window to board it up.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG1	In Zombies, headshots earn more points than body shots.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG3	For the most points, shoot a few times with a weak weapon, then finish them off with your knife.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG4	Don't waste bullets during Insta-Kill. Use your knife to get the most points!
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG5	The Mystery Box doesn't always give you something good!
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG7	The Ray Gun is great against zombies, but it can easily kill its user too.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG8	Use the default pistol and knife as much as possible in early rounds to get the most points.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG9	You can repair windows with your back to them!
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG10	The last dog of a Hellhound round always drops a Max Ammo power-up.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG11	With the Bowie Knife, your knife attacks are much faster.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG12	At the end of each round, leave a few crawling zombies alive so you can take your time at the Mystery Box.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG13	If the difficulty is too high, try the tutorial or choose Easy difficulty.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG15	Every Zombies level is made up of many rooms. Explore every corner of the map - surprises await you.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG16	There are many Perk-a-Cola machines. Each drink gives you an extra ability.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG18	Armored zombies have more health than regular zombies.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG19	Explosive weapons and sniper rifles deal extra damage to armored zombies.
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG20	Explosive weapons can blow the legs off zombies, leaving them crawling slowly on the ground.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG4	Quick Revive in Solo Mode works a little different than Co-Op Mode.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG5	Pile in! Teleporters work for the whole team not just an individual.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG13	The Cymbal Monkey takes longer to arm than grenades.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG14	Someone down? Throw a Cymbal Monkey to buy some time!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG15	Reviving your teammate in Zombies takes more time than in Multiplayer. Don't let yourself get surrounded.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG16	Power up drops only last for a limited time. So get 'em while they're hot!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG17	Manhattan DOWN!!!!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG18	Don't text message while cooking a grenade, you'll regret it...
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG19	Having trouble in Solo? Grab some friends and try the level in Co-Op.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG20	A Winter's Howl can give you time to revive a downed teammate.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG6	Fire Sale spawns all of the Mystery Boxes and slashes prices across the board!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG7	At the beginning of a new round players receive two grenades.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG8	Use all the tools at your disposal. Some attacks yield more points than shooting!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG9	After Pack-a-Punch, even the weakest weapons become something special.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG10	Is Insta-Kill on? Stab, don't shoot!
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG11	Sometimes it is better to run than revive.
PLATFORM_DYK_COOP_MSG12	Your explosives will not hurt other players, but can still hurt you!
PLATFORM_DYK_ZM_MSG21	You can use Revive Tokens to revive yourself.
