KILLSTREAKS_AC130_DESC	Be the gunner of an AC130.
KILLSTREAKS_AC130_PRO_DESC	Be the gunner of an AC130 armed with a 105mm howitzer. 11 killstreak.
KILLSTREAKS_PREDATOR_MISSILE_DESC	Remote control missile.
KILLSTREAKS_PREDATOR_MISSILE_PRO_DESC	A remote-controlled missile whose radar shows both personnel and vehicle targets. 5 killstreak.
KILLSTREAKS_HELICOPTER_MINIGUN_DESC	Be the gunner of an attack helicopter.
KILLSTREAKS_HELICOPTER_MINIGUN_PRO_DESC	Man the side minigun of an attack helicopter and strike ground targets. You stay in the helicopter longer. 11 killstreak
KILLSTREAKS_HARRIER_AIRSTRIKE_DESC	Airstrike with a hovering Harrier.\\n
KILLSTREAKS_HARRIER_AIRSTRIKE_PRO_DESC	Call in a Harrier that hovers over the battlefield attacking enemies and enemy ground turrets. It stays longer than a regular Harrier. Before hovering, a flight of jets bombs the target area. 7 killstreak
KILLSTREAKS_STEALTH_AIRSTRIKE_DESC	Airstrike undetectable on enemy maps.
KILLSTREAKS_STEALTH_AIRSTRIKE_PRO_DESC	Call in a stealth bomber to carpet bomb enemies along its path. Enemies cannot see it on radar. Covers a wider area than a regular stealth bomber. 9 killstreak
KILLSTREAKS_COUNTER_UAV_PRO_DESC	Jams enemy radar for a period of time so your team can't be detected. Lasts longer than a regular jammer. 4 killstreak
KILLSTREAKS_RCBOMB_CRATE	Press ^3&&1^7 to control the RC-XD
