KILLSTREAKS_RCBOMB_NOT_AVAILABLE	RC-XD not available
KILLSTREAKS_RCBOMB_NOT_PLACABLE	Can't place the RC-XD here
KILLSTREAKS_DOGS_INBOUND	Attack Dogs Inbound
KILLSTREAKS_DOGS_NOT_AVAILABLE	Attack Dogs not available
KILLSTREAKS_SAM_TURRET_PRO_DESC	Instantly get an advanced SAM launcher to shoot down enemy air support. Fires faster than the regular version. 4 killstreak
KILLSTREAKS_SAM_TURRET_NOT_AVAILABLE	SAM Turret not available
KILLSTREAKS_SAM_TURRET_PICKUP	Hold ^3&&1^7 to pick up the SAM Turret
KILLSTREAKS_AIRDROP_SAM_TURRET_PRO_DESC	Airdrop an advanced SAM launcher to shoot down enemy air support. Fires faster than the regular version. 4 killstreak
SPLASHES_DEFENDER_CLAN_DESC	You saved a clanmate
