CHALLENGE_RUN_N_MILES	Run &&1 miles using Marathon.
CHALLENGE_GET_N_CLOSE_DS_KILLS	Get &&1 close range kills using Ninja.
CHALLENGE_PICKUP_N_SCAVENGER_PACKS	Resupply &&1 times while using Scavenger.
CHALLENGE_GET_N_LASTSTAND_KILLS	Get &&1 kills while in Last Stand.
CHALLENGE_SPRINT_N_MILES	Sprint &&1 miles using Lightweight.
CHALLENGE_GET_N_KILLSTREAKS	Get &&1 killstreaks while using Hardline. (2 kills in a row)
CHALLENGE_KILL_N_KILLSTREAKS	Destroy &&1 enemy killstreak rewards using Cold-Blooded.
CHALLENGE_GET_N_SOH_KILLS	Get &&1 kills using Sleight of Hand.
CHALLENGE_GET_N_DE_KILLS	Destroy &&1 enemy devices while using SitRep.
CHALLENGE_DESC_THEWATCHMAN	Call in &&1 UAVs.
CHALLENGE_DESC_CARPETBOMBER	Get &&1 kills with a Precision Airstrike.
CHALLENGE_DESC_LOOKNOHANDS	Get &&1 kills with a Sentry Gun.
CHALLENGE_DESC_COBRACOMMANDER	Get &&1 kills as a Chopper Gunner.
CHALLENGE_DESC_THECHOPPER	Get &&1 kills with the Attack Helicopter.
CHALLENGE_DESC_THESPIRIT	Get &&1 kills with a Stealth Bomber.
CHALLENGE_DESC_SPECTRE	Get &&1 kills with an AC-130.
CHALLENGE_DESC_JOLLYGREENGIANT	Get &&1 kills with a Pave Low.
CHALLENGE_DESC_SHOCKWAVE	EMP the enemy team 5 times.
CHALLENGE_DESC_LIVINGDEAD	Survive Final Stand.
CHALLENGE_DESC_CLICKCLICKBOOM	Get 1 kill with C4 while in Last Stand.
CHALLENGE_CALL_IN_A_UAV_N_TIMES	Call in a UAV &&1 times.
CHALLENGE_TAVOR_MASTERY	TAR-21: Mastery
CHALLENGE_KILL_N_ENEMIES_WITH_A_GRENADE	Kill &&1 enemies with grenades.
CHALLENGE_DESC_BANGFORBUCK	Get Payback &&1 times with Frag Grenades.
CHALLENGE_DESC_RENAISSANCE	Kill 3 different people with 3 different weapons in one life.
CHALLENGE_DESC_UAV	Call in &&1 UAVs.
