SF_UI_WELCOME_NEWBIE_MSG	Welcome to Call of Duty Online! This is the newbie channel, where you can share tips and get the latest info on new-player events.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_SPECOPS_NAME	Challenge Missions Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_SPECOPS_DESCRIPTION	Congratulations on unlocking Challenge missions! As an elite operator, your true tactical skills will be put to the test in these missions. Of course, the bigger the challenge, the bigger the reward!\n \nWe strongly recommend teaming up with a friend!\nPro tip: create a party first, invite a friend, then start the mission.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_SPECOPS_DETAIL	Select the "Challenge" tab to find missions
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COOP_ROOM_CREATION_NAME	Room Creation Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COOP_ROOM_CREATION_DESCRIPTION	Congratulations on unlocking room creation! You can now create a room and play with your friends.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COOP_ROOM_CREATION_DETAIL	Open the room creation menu here
SF_UI_UNLOCK_WEAPON_CUSTOMIZATION_NAME	Classes Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_WEAPON_CUSTOMIZATION_DESCRIPTION	Classes unlocked! You can now customize your weapons, add attachments, and change your perks and killstreaks
SF_UI_UNLOCK_WEAPON_CUSTOMIZATION_DETAIL	See Class on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_TRAINING_PLAYLIST_NAME	Multiplayer Training Playlist Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_TRAINING_PLAYLIST_DESCRIPTION	The Multiplayer Training playlist mixes players and bots. New maps and challenges!\n \nGood luck!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_TRAINING_PLAYLIST_DETAIL	See the Multiplayer Training playlist on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_AVATAR_CUSTOMIZATION_NAME	Character Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_AVATAR_CUSTOMIZATION_DESCRIPTION	You can now outfit your character in the style of Task Force 141 or Shadow Company. Show off your style and achievements!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_AVATAR_CUSTOMIZATION_DETAIL	See Character on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COMBAT_TRAINING_NAME	Combat Training Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COMBAT_TRAINING_DESCRIPTION	You can now practice against bots with zero pressure.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_COMBAT_TRAINING_DETAIL	See Combat Training on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_NOOB_TDM_NAME	New Playlist Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_NOOB_TDM_DESCRIPTION	Rookie Team Deathmatch is open only to players level 10 to 20. New maps and challenges! In Combat Training you and your friends can practice against bots on many new maps. Happy hunting!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_NOOB_TDM_DETAIL	See Rookie Team Deathmatch on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_ROOM_LIST_NAME	Room List Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_ROOM_LIST_DESCRIPTION	Find a room you want to join.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_ROOM_LIST_DETAIL	See Room List on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_ROOM_CREATION_NAME	Room Creation Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_ROOM_CREATION_DESCRIPTION	You can now create your own room and play with friends! Rewards are slightly lower than multiplayer playlists, but the rules are more flexible.
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_ROOM_CREATION_DETAIL	See Room Creation on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_PLAYLIST_NAME	All Multiplayer Playlists Unlocked!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_PLAYLIST_DESCRIPTION	All kinds of multiplayer game modes are now unlocked, including Team Deathmatch, Search and Destroy and many more!\nGood luck, soldier!
SF_UI_UNLOCK_MP_PLAYLIST_DETAIL	See the new playlists on the left
SF_UI_UNLOCK_ZM_ASYLUM_SH_NAME	Mech Research Lab Difficulties Unlocked
SF_UI_UNLOCK_ZM_ASYLUM_SH_DESCRIPTION	Congratulations! You've unlocked Regular and Hard difficulty for Mech Research Lab.
