SF_WEAPON_ACR_MP_DESC	A next-generation assault rifle with excellent fire rate and stability, and one of the longest-range assault rifles.
SF_WEAPON_TMP_MP_DESC	A machine pistol firing 9x19mm Parabellum rounds
