MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TRAINING_MP_KILLHOUSE	New Arrival -- Arrive at Task Force 141's secret base for your first basic training.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TRAINING_MP_KILLHOUSE_2	You have completed basic training. Welcome to Task Force 141!
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TAKE_MP_FAV_TROPICAL	Simple Job -- Head to Juanito to meet a local informant and get vital intel on the Cortez cartel.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TAKE_MP_FAV_TROPICAL_2	The 141 team's meeting with Ortiz turned out to be a trap. The team fought through the Cortez gang's blockades and chased Ortiz through the alleys of the favela. Ghost finally caught him, and after some "friendly" questioning, Ortiz gave up the location of Vazquez's office in Oderan. The 141 team set out at once.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_DEFENSE_MP_CRASH_TROPICAL	Into Enemy Hands -- Enter the town of Oderan and search for intel on Vazquez. Find out who he's working with and where he's hiding.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_DEFENSE_MP_CRASH_TROPICAL_2	As soon as it entered the airspace over Oderan, the 141 team's helicopter took an RPG to the rotor and went down. Most of the team was captured and later rescued by Ghost. The intel they gathered shows Vazquez had been shipping a suspicious cargo to Bakar. They also found Vazquez's hideout and are preparing to take him down.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TAKE_MP_ESTATE_TROPICAL	Bloody Estate -- Infiltrate the estate, eliminate the guards and capture the leader of the Cortez cartel - Vazquez.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_TAKE_MP_ESTATE_TROPICAL_2	After a hard fight, the 141 team dragged Vazquez out of his panic room. But during the extraction, Vazquez was sniped by an unknown hostile force. They swarmed in, trying to erase every trace of Vazquez and his associates. That this force would go to such lengths over Vazquez only raises more questions about the cargo he shipped and the identity of its buyer...
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_EVASION_MP_CON_SPRING	Snowbound -- Sneak to the outskirts of the base. Avoid the sentries and dog patrols along the way.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_SNIPERFI_MP_CON_SPRING	Behind Enemy Lines -- Cover Ghost while he gathers enemy intel and hold off the enemy's furious assault.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_ESCAPE_MP_STORM_SPRING	Unknown Cargo -- Break through the enemy defenses into the plant's control room, gather the intel there and escape with Soap.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_AC_MP_HUNTED_SPRING	Fire From the Sky -- The chemical plant is about to be leveled! Man the AC130 and cover Ghost's escape to the rendezvous point.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_SUSPENSION_MP_BRIDGE	The Truth Revealed -- Chase the Nova 6 convoy across the bridge and stop it from reaching the city.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_CHOPPER_MP_SUBURBS	Race Against Time -- Time is running out. Hurry to Nate's Restaurant and provide fire support from the helicopter for Ghost on the ground.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_COOP_DEFENSE_MP_SUBURBS	Hanging by a Thread -- Harker's last stand. Draw enemy fire outside the restaurant to buy time for Soap while he defuses the Nova 6.
MPUI_NAR_MAP_ZM_ASYLUM	This was once a lab building researching robotics, but now it has been overrun by zombies. Can you fight your way out?
MPUI_NAR_MAP_ZM_PROTOTYPE	A facility in an abandoned industrial city. The zombie outbreak seems to have started here.
