SPECIAL_OPS_SO_HIDDEN_SO_GHILLIES	Hidden
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_HIDDEN_SO_GHILLIES_DESC	Evade enemy patrols and snipers near Chernobyl.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_AC130_CO_HUNTED	Overwatch
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_AC130_CO_HUNTED_DESC	Man an AC130 and provide covering fire from the air for your partner.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_AC130_CO_HUNTED_OBJ_DESC	Reach the farmhouse basement \nReach the workshop on the western edge \nReach the greenhouse near the barn
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CHOPPER_INVASION	Big Brother
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CHOPPER_INVASION_DESC	Use explosives, the minigun and a Black Hawk to clear the road.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_FAVELA	O Cristo Redentor
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_FAVELA_DESC	Hunt down and wipe out the favela militia while keeping civilian casualties to a minimum.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SNOWRACE1_CLIFFHANGER	Race
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SNOWRACE1_CLIFFHANGER_DESC	Race a snowmobile down the mountain, avoiding trees, rocks and cliffs.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SNOWRACE1_CLIFFHANGER_OBJ_DESC	Finish in under 2 minutes\nFinish in under 90 seconds \nFinish in under 70 seconds
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEFUSE_FAVELA_ESCAPE	Bomb Squad
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEFUSE_FAVELA_ESCAPE_DESC	Race through the favela market, find the bombs and defuse them in time.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_FOREST_CONTINGENCY	Evasion
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_FOREST_CONTINGENCY_DESC	Use your silenced sniper rifle wisely and slip past enemy patrols.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_INVASION	Wolverines!
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_INVASION_DESC	Rack up enough kills. Kill enemies quickly for bigger bonuses.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ASSAULT_OILRIG	Wet Work
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ASSAULT_OILRIG_DESC	Breach and clear two rooms packed with enemies and hostages to take control of the oil rig.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEMO_SO_BRIDGE	Wreckage
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEMO_SO_BRIDGE_DESC	Use C4, grenade launchers, RPGs, sentry guns, Semtex and more to destroy every vehicle on the bridge.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SABOTAGE_CLIFFHANGER	Acceptable Losses
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SABOTAGE_CLIFFHANGER_DESC	Use silenced weapons and a heartbeat sensor to sabotage an enemy airbase deep behind enemy lines.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SHOWERS_GULAG	Breach & Clear
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SHOWERS_GULAG_DESC	Crush the enemy defenses in the gulag, then get out.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_TAKEOVER_OILRIG	Armor Piercing
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_TAKEOVER_OILRIG_DESC	Kill all 15 Juggernauts on the oil rig.\nThis is nearly impossible.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SNOWRACE2_CLIFFHANGER	Time Trial
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SNOWRACE2_CLIFFHANGER_DESC	Drive your snowmobile through the canyon before time runs out. Pass through flag gates to earn more time.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_INTEL_BONEYARD	Snatch & Grab
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_INTEL_BONEYARD_DESC	Fight the Shadow Company and Juggernauts in the aircraft boneyard. Grab the intel and head to the extraction point.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ESCAPE_AIRPORT	Terminal
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ESCAPE_AIRPORT_DESC	Break through the enemy riot shield ambush.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_TRAINER	The Pit
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_TRAINER_DESC	Kill all enemies as fast as possible. Shooting civilians will prevent a three-star rating.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_TRAINER_OBJ_DESC	Complete the course \nFinish in under 45 seconds \nFinish in under 35 seconds
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_JUGGERNAUTS_FAVELA	High Explosive
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_JUGGERNAUTS_FAVELA_DESC	Kill all 10 Juggernauts using only explosives and your knife. You'd have to be crazy to try this.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CROSSING_SO_BRIDGE	A Bridge Too Far
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CROSSING_SO_BRIDGE_DESC	Rout the enemy invasion force on the bridge and reach safety.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEFENSE_INVASION	Homeland Security
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DEFENSE_INVASION_DESC	Use sentry guns, thermal scopes, rocket launchers and Claymores to survive 5 waves of frenzied enemy attacks.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ROOFTOP_CONTINGENCY	Sniper Fi
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ROOFTOP_CONTINGENCY_DESC	Use sniper rifles, Claymores and a Predator drone to hold off wave after wave of enemies.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DOWNLOAD_ARCADIA	Wardriving
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DOWNLOAD_ARCADIA_DESC	Laze targets for the Stryker. Fight house to house through the suburbs.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_TAKEOVER_ESTATE	Estate Takedown
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_TAKEOVER_ESTATE_DESC	Wipe out the enemy snipers. The safehouse is guarded by elite mercenaries and Juggernauts.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ALPHA_DESC	Predator drones, favela militia, sniper rifles and stealth. These ops are short and sweet.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_BETA_DESC	AC130s, snowmobile races and miniguns loaded with high-explosive rounds. Fun for the whole family.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CHARLIE_DESC	Time limits, explosive breaches, an aircraft boneyard and ghillie-suited enemies. Things are getting tricky.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DELTA_DESC	Blizzards, airports, estates and bridges. 5 challenging missions.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ECHO_DESC	Oil rigs and favelas, with Juggernauts everywhere. These ops are fast and brutal.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_BETA_UNLOCK_DESC	Requires 4 stars to unlock
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CHARLIE_UNLOCK_DESC	Requires 8 stars to unlock
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DELTA_UNLOCK_DESC	Requires 20 stars to unlock
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ECHO_UNLOCK_DESC	Requires 40 stars to unlock
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_UNLOCK_DESC	Earn stars to unlock.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_BETA_UNLOCK_NOTICE	Bravo missions unlocked!
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_CHARLIE_UNLOCK_NOTICE	Charlie missions unlocked!
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_DELTA_UNLOCK_NOTICE	Delta missions unlocked!
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ECHO_UNLOCK_NOTICE	Echo missions unlocked!
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SELECT_AC130_GUNNER	Select AC130 Gunner
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_SELECT_CHOPPER_GUNNER	Select Chopper Gunner
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_KILLSPREE_FAVELA_OBJ_DESC	30 enemies, max 6 civilian casualties. \n40 enemies and dogs, 4 civilian casualties. \n50 enemies and dogs, 3 civilian casualties.
SPECIAL_OPS_SO_ROOFTOP_CONTINGENCY_OBJ_DESC	3 infantry waves, 1 jeep and 1 truck \n4 infantry waves, 2 jeeps and 1 truck \n5 infantry waves, 3 jeeps and 2 trucks
