SF_WEAPON_MAG_STDASSDIY2_NAME	Modified Assault Rifle Magazine 2
SF_WEAPON_MAG_STDASSDIY2_DESC	Modified standard assault rifle magazine
SF_WEAPON_FAMAS_MP_DESC	A highly accurate and powerful assault rifle. Fires in 3-round bursts and is effective at medium to long range.
SF_WEAPON_LAS_USP_DESC	Tactical flashlight
SF_WEAPON_LAS_USP_NAME	Tactical flashlight
SF_WEAPON_USP_MP_DESC	A versatile .45 semi-automatic tactical pistol used by many special forces units. Well-balanced in every respect.
SF_WEAPON_CHEYTAC_MP_DESC	One of the most popular bolt-action sniper rifles. Unmatched accuracy with good stopping power and mobility.
SF_WEAPON_L86_MP_DESC	A support LMG derived from the SA80 rifle family. Large-capacity magazine and high mobility, but sustained fire takes skill.
SF_WEAPON_BARRETT_MP_DESC	The Barrett semi-automatic anti-materiel/sniper rifle. Extreme range and damage against both soft and hard targets, but its heavy weight lowers mobility.
SF_WEAPON_AT4_MP_DESC	A classic single-shot disposable rocket launcher. Highly accurate; fire freely or lock on to vehicles. Carries 1 rocket.
SF_WEAPON_COLTANACONDA_MP_DESC	A revolver firing .44 Magnum rounds. Powerful and stable.
SF_WEAPON_COLTANACONDA_MP_NAME	.44 Magnum
SF_WEAPON_PP2000_MP_DESC	Pistol size and weight with SMG firepower make it an excellent secondary. Drawbacks are heavy recoil and a small magazine.
SF_WEAPON_FOR_GRESWATM203_DESC	Underbarrel grenade launcher. Fits most rifles.
SF_WEAPON_FOR_GRESWATM203_NAME	M203
SF_WEAPON_RED_SWAT1_DESC	A bright red dot in the center of the lens for fast close-range aiming.
SF_WEAPON_RED_SWAT1_NAME	Red Dot Sight
SF_WEAPON_SHO_MKSWAT_DESC	Underbarrel shotgun. Fits most rifles.
SF_WEAPON_SHO_MKSWAT_NAME	Underbarrel Shotgun
SF_WEAPON_M16_MP_DESC	An assault rifle developed from the legendary M16. This model fires 3-round bursts with sniper-rifle-like accuracy.
SF_WEAPON_GRI_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Rear Grip
SF_WEAPON_GRI_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Rear Grip
SF_WEAPON_IRO_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Iron Sights
SF_WEAPON_IRO_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Iron Sights
SF_WEAPON_MAG_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Magazine
SF_WEAPON_MAG_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Magazine
SF_WEAPON_MUZ_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Muzzle
SF_WEAPON_MUZ_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Muzzle
SF_WEAPON_RAI_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Rail
SF_WEAPON_RAI_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Rail
SF_WEAPON_STO_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard Stock
SF_WEAPON_STO_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard Stock
SF_WEAPON_RPD_MP_DESC	Fully automatic with good accuracy. Suited to medium and long range combat.
SF_WEAPON_SCAR_MP_DESC	A SCAR assault rifle with a heavy 7.62mm barrel. High damage, high accuracy and low recoil, but a small magazine.
SF_WEAPON_MG4_MP_DESC	A squad light machine gun with excellent performance. Belt-fed, it is an outstanding suppression/support weapon.
SF_WEAPON_VECTOR_MP_DESC	An innovative SMG firing large-caliber pistol rounds. Very high rate of fire with surprisingly low recoil.
SF_WEAPON_VECTOR_MP_NAME	Vector
SF_WEAPON_AA12_MP_DESC	A fully automatic assault shotgun fed from an 8-round magazine. Deadly at close range, but lacking in range.
SF_WEAPON_TAR21_MP_DESC	A compact bullpup assault rifle with excellent accuracy and reliable performance.
SF_WEAPON_G18_MP_DESC	A fully automatic machine pistol with a very high rate of fire. Dense firepower, massive recoil.
SF_WEAPON_P90_MP_DESC	The original personal defense weapon. Futuristic design and good ergonomics; its 50-round magazine and very high rate of fire make it an ideal close-quarters weapon, but it reloads slowly.
SF_WEAPON_STINGER_MP_DESC	A classic man-portable anti-air missile. Uses infrared guidance to lock on and track targets. Carries 2 missiles.
SF_WEAPON_STINGER_MP_NAME	Stinger
SF_WEAPON_M1014_MP_DESC	A semi-automatic shotgun. Highly mobile and powerful up close, but has a small magazine.
SF_WEAPON_AUG_MP_DESC	A powerful light machine gun with moderate recoil and the best portability of any LMG.
SF_WEAPON_LAS_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard laser sight
SF_WEAPON_LAS_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard laser sight
SF_WEAPON_STRIKER_MP_DESC	A fully automatic shotgun fed by a 12-round rotary drum. Fairly accurate at close to medium range. 
SF_WEAPON_STRIKER_MP_NAME	Striker
SF_WEAPON_WA2000_MP_DESC	A retro-styled German sniper rifle; only 176 were ever made. Its bullpup design is compact yet very accurate.
SF_WEAPON_BIP_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard bipod
SF_WEAPON_BIP_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard bipod
SF_WEAPON_SCO_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard scope
SF_WEAPON_SCO_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard scope
SF_WEAPON_M93_MP_DESC	A machine pistol with 3-round burst. Small and easy to handle, it provides accurate support fire at medium range.
SF_WEAPON_FOR_DEFAULT_DESC	Standard foregrip
SF_WEAPON_FOR_DEFAULT_NAME	Standard foregrip
SF_WEAPON_AK47_MP_DESC	The legendary AK-47 (AKM) assault rifle. High damage, but it takes some skill to master.
SF_WEAPON_MINIUZI_MP_DESC	A scaled-down version of the standard Uzi with a higher rate of fire.
SF_WEAPON_MINIUZI_MP_NAME	Mini-Uzi
SF_WEAPON_M240_MP_DESC	A general-purpose machine gun firing 7.62mm belt-fed ammo. Carries lots of ammo, ideal for suppressive fire.
SF_WEAPON_M21EBR_MP_DESC	A marksman rifle developed from the M14 EBR, with an extended barrel and large sniper scope. Good accuracy and damage, and more portable than a dedicated sniper rifle.
SF_WEAPON_FN2000_MP_DESC	A modern bullpup assault rifle with forward ejection, offering SMG-like fire rate and portability.
SF_WEAPON_FAL_MP_DESC	A powerful assault rifle on par with the AK. Full-auto recoil was too hard to control, so it fires semi-auto, with sniper-rifle-like accuracy.
SF_WEAPON_DESERTEAGLE_MP_DESC	A star among large semi-automatic pistols, with massive stopping power and equally massive recoil.
SF_WEAPON_MODEL1887_MP_DESC	The classic of classics. Terrifying close-range damage and a sky-high lethality rate, but very slow to fire and reload.
SF_WEAPON_JAVELIN_MP_DESC	The famous "fire and forget" man-portable anti-tank missile. Veterans can even use it against enemy aircraft and other soft and hard targets.
SF_WEAPON_JAVELIN_MP_NAME	Javelin
SF_WEAPON_RPG_MP_DESC	The famous shoulder-fired rocket launcher. Deals massive damage to personnel and air and ground targets, but cannot lock on and has low accuracy.
