SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_OBJECTIVEKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to see your objectives.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_PRONEKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to go prone
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_DOUBLETAPPRONEKEY	Double tap [&&1] to go prone
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_HOLDDOWNPRONEKEY	Hold down [&&1] to go prone
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_ADSKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to aim down the sight
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_HOLDDOWNADSKEY	Hold down [&&1] to aim down the sight
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDFROMPRONEKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to stand up from prone
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_DOUBLETAPSTANDKEY	Double tap [&&1] to stand from prone
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_SWITCHTOGRENADE	Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch to grenades
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_MELEEATTACK	Press^3 &&1 ^7to do a melee attack
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_DOG_DEATH_TOO_SOON	Wait for the dog to bite to grab its throat. ^3([{+melee}])^7 
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_DOG_DEATH_TOO_LATE	Melee the dog before it bites to grab its throat. ^3([{+melee}])^7 
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_DOG_DEATH_DO_NOTHING	Melee the dog right when it bites to grab its throat. ^3([{+melee}])^7 
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_DOG_HINT	Press ^3([{+melee}])^7
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_LEANOUTWINDOW	Press USE^3 &&1 ^7to lean out of the window
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_FIRSTOBJECTIVE	Look at your first objective and press USE^3 &&1 ^7to retrieve
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STRAFELEFT	Press your Move Left key^3 &&1 ^7to move left.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STRAFERIGHT	Press your Move Right key^3 &&1 ^7to move right.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_MOVEFORWARD	Press your Move Forward key^3 &&1 ^7to move forward.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_MOVEBACKWARD	Press your Move Back key^3 &&1 ^7to move backwards.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_CHECKCURRENTOBJECTIVE	Press^3 &&1 ^7to check your current objective.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_SWITCHTOSECONDWEAPON	You now have two weapons. Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch to your second weapon.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_TRAINING_SWITCHTOGRENADE	Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch to your grenades.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_CROUCHKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to crouch.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_CROUCHTOGGLEFROM	Press^3 &&1 ^7a second time to stand up from crouch.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_HOLDDOWNCROUCHKEY	Hold down [&&1] to crouch.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_RAISEFROMPRONETOCROUCH	Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch from crouch from prone.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to stand up.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDLETGOCROUCHKEY	Let go of [&&1] to stop crouching.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDLETGOSECONDKEY	If this makes you go prone, double tap [&&1].
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDFROMCROUCHKEY	Double tap [&&1] to stand up from crouch.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_RAISEFROMCROUCHTOSTAND	Single tap [&&1] to stand from crouch.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_STANDLETGOPRONEKEY	Let go of [&&1] to come out of prone.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_ADSSTOP	Press^3 &&1 ^7a second time to stop aiming down the sight.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_FIRSTWEAPONKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch to your first weapon.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_SECONDWEAPONKEY	Press^3 &&1 ^7to switch to your second weapon.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_SWAPWEAPONSKEY	HOLD USE [&&1] to swap your current weapon for another that you are looking at.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_PICKUPWEAPONKEY	To pickup a weapon, look at it and press USE^3 &&1 ^7.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_JUMPSTANDKEY	While standing, press^3 &&1 ^7to jump.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_LEANLEFTKEY	Hold down [&&1] to lean to the left.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_LEANRIGHTKEY	Hold down [&&1] to lean to the right.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINTSTR_PICKUPGRENADES	Press^3 &&1 ^7to pick up the grenades.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINTSTR_PLANTEXPLOSIVES	Press^3 &&1 ^7to plant the explosives.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINTSTR_PICKUPEXPLOSIVES	Press^3 &&1 ^7to pick up the explosives.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_RELOAD	Press^3 &&1 ^7to reload at any time.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINTSTR_TAKEEXPLOSIVES	Press^3 &&1 ^7to take the explosives.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_FIRE_TO_SKIP	Press Fire to skip
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_AC130_HINT_ZOOM_AND_FIRE	Press ^3[{+speed}]^7 to zoom, ^3[{+attack}]^7 to fire
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_AC130_HINT_TOGGLE_THERMAL	Press ^3[{+activate}]^7 to toggle thermal\nbetween white-hot and black-hot
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_PLANTBEACON	Press^3 &&1 ^7to plant the IR beacon.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_LAUNCHFACILITY_A_HINT_PLANT_C4_GLOW	To plant C4, approach the glowing objective marker and hold ^3[{+activate}]^7.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_LAUNCHFACILITY_A_HINT_SMOKE	Throw smoke ^3[{+smoke}]^7 to safely approach the enemy vehicle.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_PLANTEXPLOSIVES	Look at the explosives spot and press^3 &&1 ^7to plant the explosives.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_GET_DETONATOR	Hold down^3 &&1 ^7to pick up the detonator.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_SPOOL_MINIGUN	Press and hold ^3[{+speed_throw}]^7 to spool up the minigun.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_CHEAT_USETOSLOWMO	Use ^3[{+melee}]^7 to start or stop Slow-Mo.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_LEARN_CHOPPER_AIR_SUPPORT2	Press ^3[{+attack}]^7 to give attack coordinates.
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_OILRIG_HINT_STEALTH_KILL	Press^3 [{+melee}] ^7to take down the guard
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_BREACH_ACTIVATE	Press^3 [{+activate}] ^7to breach
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_SNOWMOBILE_ATTACK	Press ^3[{+attack}]^7 to fire
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_SNOWMOBILE_DRIVE	Hold ^3[{+forward}]^7 to drive
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_SNOWMOBILE_REVERSE	Press ^3[{+back}]^7 to reverse
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_ZODIAC_STEADY	Hold ^3[{+stance}]^7 to steady the boat
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_MINIGUN_SPIN_HINT	^3[{+speed}]^7 = Spin Up
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_MINIGUN_FIRE_HINT	^3[{+attack}]^7 = Fire
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINTSTR_POPFLARE	Press ^3[{+attack}]^7 to pop flares
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_STEER_DRONE	Use the mouse to guide the missile
SCRIPT_PLATFORM_HINT_FLASH	Press ^3[{+smoke}]^7 to throw a flashbang
DEADQUOTE_SO_TRY_NEW_DIFFICULTY	Tip\nIf a Special Op is too hard or too easy, try a different difficulty.
DEADQUOTE_SO_BLED_OUT	Tip\nA teammate bled out. Work as a team and revive each other when someone goes down.
DEADQUOTE_SO_TEXT_COLOR_DIFFICULTY	Tip\nWhen choosing a mission, red text means a higher difficulty than green text.
DEADQUOTE_SO_SEARCH_FOR_WEAPONS	Tip\nKeep an eye out for special weapons that can help you.
DEADQUOTE_SO_TOGGLE_TIMER	Tip\nPress^3 [{+actionslot 1}] ^7to toggle the timer and mission status.
DEADQUOTE_SO_TOGGLE_WEAP_ALT_MODE	Tip\nSome weapons have an underbarrel grenade launcher or shotgun.
DEADQUOTE_SO_CRAWL_TO_TEAMMATE	Tip\nIf you go down, try crawling toward your teammate.
DEADQUOTE_SO_STAY_NEAR_TEAMMATE	Tip\nStay close to your teammate and move together.
DEADQUOTE_SO_FRIENDLY_FIRE_HINT	Tip\nYou can hurt your teammate! Avoid friendly fire.
DEADQUOTE_SO_RED_FIND_COVER	Tip\nWhen everything turns red, find cover fast.
DEADQUOTE_SO_LEFT_PLAY_AREA	Tip\nHold your ground!\nYou abandoned the mission.
DEADQUOTE_SO_FIND_FRIEND_COOP	Tip\nNobody fights alone!\nTeam up with a friend in split-screen or co-op.
DEADQUOTE_SO_THROW_FLASHBANG	Tip\nThrow flashbangs to stun enemies.
DEADQUOTE_SO_GRENADES_ROLL	Tip\nLook out! Grenades roll downhill.
DEADQUOTE_SO_BEAT_BEST_TIME	Tip\nTry to beat your personal best.\nExperiment with different strategies and routes.
DEADQUOTE_SO_FRIENDLY_FIRE_KILL	Tip\nMission failed due to friendly fire.
DEADQUOTE_RIOTSHIELD_USE_EXPLOSIVE	Tip\nAgainst enemies with riot shields, try grenades, RPGs and grenade launchers.
DEADQUOTE_RIOTSHIELD_OUT_FLANK	Tip\nRiot shields only protect the front! Flank them and they're no tougher than regular enemies.
DEADQUOTE_RIOTSHIELD_DONT_CHARGE	Tip\nKeep your distance! Charging an enemy with a riot shield is a bad idea.
DEADQUOTE_SO_STAR_RANKINGS	Tip\nComplete an op on Hardened to earn 2 stars. Veteran earns 3 stars.
DEADQUOTE_SO_ICON_PARTNER	Tip\nFind your teammate by their name. If they are off screen, a green arrow points in their direction.
DEADQUOTE_SO_ICON_OBJ	Tip\nA white dot marks the objective location.
DEADQUOTE_SO_ICON_OBJ_OFFSCREEN	Tip\nWhen the objective is out of view, its icon changes.
DEADQUOTE_THOSE_WHO_PLOT_THE_DESTRUCTION	"Those who plot the destruction of others often perish in the attempt." - Thomas More
DEADQUOTE_IN_TAKING_REVENGE_A_MAN	"In taking revenge, a man is but even with his enemy; but in passing it over, he is superior." - Francis Bacon
DEADQUOTE_ONE_GOOD_ACT_OF_VENGEANCE	"One good act of vengeance deserves another." - Jon Jefferson
DEADQUOTE_YOU_CANNOT_GET_AHEAD	"You cannot get ahead while you are getting even." - Dick Armey
DEADQUOTE_DONT_GET_MAD_GET_EVEN	"Don't get mad, get even." - Robert F. Kennedy
DEADQUOTE_REVENGE_IS_PROFITABLE	"Revenge is profitable." - Edward Gibbon
DEADQUOTE_AN_EYE_FOR_AN_EYE_MAKES	"An eye for an eye makes the whole world blind." - Gandhi
