ZOMBIE_STORY_INTRO_THEATER3	Resistance Cell Alpha
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTRO_THEATER4	Garrick Theater
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E1	Mech Operating Manual
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E1_DESC	Protect the mech's head. Damage to the head is very hard to repair. Looks like aiming for a mech zombie's head might do extra damage...
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E2	Photo - Good Friends
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E2_DESC	Mechs were once humanity's trusted helpers at home and at work, then overnight they turned on their owners. What happened?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E3_DESC	Mechs spread across the world in no time. Millions are now in service. They have become an essential part of daily life, and you can see them everywhere you go.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E4	New Drink Machine Flyer
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_E4_DESC	Great news! Try the new Nano Drink. A full daily dose keeps you energized and ready for any challenge!
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M1	Survivor's Diary (I)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M1_DESC	May 19. Chased and cornered by mech zombies, we finally fought our way to this abandoned building. The drink machines here gave us a breather, but the power to them seems to be off.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M2	Model - Mech Head
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M2_DESC	As future technology advanced rapidly, humanity learned to build highly intelligent robots and put them to work in every field, boosting productivity or taking over dangerous jobs.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M3	Advanced Schematic (Page 1)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M3_DESC	This schematic seems to be for a deadlier kind of mech. It looks finished... Could it really show up?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M4	Advanced Schematic (Page 2)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_M4_DESC	(Continued) Due to its unstable materials, this mech explodes when destroyed, and can even take out other mechs within a certain radius.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H1	Classified Document
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H1_DESC	The AI programs inside the mechs appear to have been tampered with, causing them to attack humanity en masse. But who did it?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H2	Survivor's Diary (II)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H2_DESC	May 25. We finally found the power switch, but when we turned it on, something we never expected happened... (the rest of the document is illegible)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H3	World Map
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H3_DESC	If you follow the route on this map, you may find the source of all this.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H4	Scribbled Note
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_PROTO_H4_DESC	Maybe the drink machines can be powered some other way without turning on the power, and avoid unnecessary trouble... but where do we find it?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E1	Developer's Diary (I)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M3	Survivor's Diary (II)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E1_DESC	Sept 17. To avoid being surrounded by mech zombies, we had to cut the power and trigger the emergency system to close the security gate in the middle of the room...
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E2	Promotional Poster
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E2_DESC	A poster for a new drink. It claims that after drinking it you can revive downed teammates faster. Can it really be that good?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E3	Newspaper
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E3_DESC	This article reports that since mechs took over people's everyday work, rates of illness have risen sharply and people's health keeps getting worse.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E4	Survivor's Diary (I)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_E4_DESC	This damn rescue chopper, why does it always land at the point farthest from us?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M1	Classified Document (I)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M1_DESC	Humanity must not rely too heavily on mechs. If this goes on, sooner or later mankind will be wiped out!
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M2	Classified Document (II)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M2_DESC	Better to alter the mechs' programming beforehand and sabotage their functions to disable them. (Signed: HUMAN)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M3_DESC	We thought we could just hunker down in one spot and hold out, but there were more mech zombies than we ever imagined. Better to fight on the move...
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M4	Weapon Diagram
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_M4_DESC	You've never seen the gun in this diagram. It seems to be a new weapon in development that deals wide-area electric shock damage.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H1	Ray Gun Schematic
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H1_DESC	This manual explains the inner workings of the Ray Gun. Its rounds deal explosive damage, so be careful not to hurt yourself.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H2	Trap Manual
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H2_DESC	Electric traps have been installed in the building for emergencies. If one is left on too long, it will go into cooldown.
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H3_DESC	As planned, we successfully sabotaged the mechs' programming. We thought they would simply stop working, but instead...
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H3	Researcher's Diary (I)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H4	Researcher's Diary (II)
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTEL_ASYLUM_H4_DESC	We checked the sabotage program over and over and found no errors. So why didn't the mechs stop working, and why did they start attacking humans?
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTRO_ONBOARDING1	Zombies
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTRO_ONBOARDING3	"City of the Future"
ZOMBIE_STORY_INTRO_ONBOARDING2	Day 1
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E1	Diary - 1
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E1_DESC	My name is Winston Hank. I'm serving in the 141, a born soldier.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E2	Image - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M1	Diary - 1
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M1_DESC	My name is Winston Hank. I'm serving in the 141, a born soldier.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M2	Diary - 2
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M2_DESC	Today I thought again about that tragic day, when a nuke on a timer turned 30,000 soldiers to ash in an instant. Will that happen to me one day too?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M3	Diary - 3
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M3_DESC	General Shepherd has been promoted. He is now the top commander of U.S. forces in the Middle East.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M4	Diary - 4
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_M4_DESC	Just got back from a mission, picked up another minor wound. These boring fights just don't satisfy me.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PIT_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M1	Diary - 5
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M1_DESC	Soap, Ghost and the others really enjoy this way of life. Looks like I'm not cut from the same cloth.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M2	Diary - 6
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M2_DESC	On today's mission I saw a gang of militia smuggling weapons. None of my business anyway, so I let them go.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M3	Diary - 7
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M3_DESC	Those guys in the 141 sure have a sense of justice. If you ask me, finishing the mission is all that matters. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M4	Diary - 8
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_M4_DESC	Back at base. There was a little accident, but the mission got done.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_FAVELA_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M1	Diary - 9
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M1_DESC	I've noticed General Shepherd changing. He's getting more and more fed up with the government. Looks like I need to make some changes too.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M2	Diary - 10
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M2_DESC	Turns out those arms smugglers from before were with the Cortez Cartel. Today an informant said the cartel's boss wants a word with me. This could be an opportunity.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M3	Diary - 11
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M3_DESC	The Cortez Cartel deals in arms and drugs, and bribes the military to protect its smuggling.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M4	Diary - 12
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_M4_DESC	Today I finally made contact with a Cortez Cartel lieutenant. Seems I have some intel they want.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CRASH_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M1	Diary - 13
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M1_DESC	These people are real brutes, but they're still useful. Fine, I'll agree to work with them for now.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M2	Diary - 14
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M2_DESC	Today the lieutenants took me to meet Vazquez, the boss of the organization, a drug-dealing upstart. But from the way he talks, his ambitions are small. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M3	Diary - 15
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M3_DESC	Today was my first deal. Easy as pie. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M4	Diary - 16
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_M4_DESC	With my intel, business is booming for the cartel, but drugs and guns still aren't enough to satisfy my appetite. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_ESTATE_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M1	Diary - 17
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M1_DESC	And the Cortez Cartel's fighters are just too weak. Against a unit like the 141 they'd be finished.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M2	Diary - 18
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M2_DESC	Looks like I need to build a force of my own. I need an excuse to talk this idea over with Vazquez.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M3	Diary - 19
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M3_DESC	Vazquez finally agreed to put up the money and let me build a secret force. Just wait and see. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M4	Diary - 20
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_M4_DESC	What should I call this force? Every name I've thought of is already taken. I have to come up with something cool.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_EVASION_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M1	Diary - 21
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M1_DESC	Hmm, Shadow Company. Good name, that's the one. I'd love to put up a recruitment poster.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M2	Diary - 22
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M2_DESC	The soldiers of the 141 are too independent, always doing things their own way. Not what I need. So who should I recruit?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M3	Diary - 23
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M3_DESC	The most ruthless veterans, and the locals with nowhere to go once the war is over. Those are the people I need. The ones the world has abandoned make the best fighters.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M4	Diary - 24
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_M4_DESC	To make them even more effective, I've decided to give the members of this outfit total freedom of action.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SNIPERFI_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M1	Diary - 25
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M1_DESC	My years as an instructor in the 141 have really paid off. My Shadow Company is hungrier for battle than any of them. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M2	Diary - 26
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M2_DESC	Vazquez is nagging me again, telling me to stop focusing on the secret force because drugs and guns are what make money. What does he know?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M3	Diary - 27
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M3_DESC	Today some Russians came to see Vazquez about a big deal. Normally the lieutenants handle ordinary business. 
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M4	Diary - 28
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_M4_DESC	Watching the Russians storm off, it looks like the deal fell through. Now I'm even more curious about it.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_CHEM_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M1	Diary - 29
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M1_DESC	So they were Russian ultranationalists, and they're making Nova 6. Ha, it really is a big deal. Vazquez, if you won't take it, I will
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M2	Diary - 30
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M2_DESC	Finally got in touch with those Russians. Now I need to figure out how to get them to work with me.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M3	Diary - 31
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M3_DESC	Those Russians are too easy to please. I can get the info they want from inside the 141. A godsend. Let's do something big.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M4	Diary - 32
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_M4_DESC	Vazquez is still obsessed with his drug and arms business. Enjoy the days you have left, pal.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_OVERWATCH_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M1	Diary - 33
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M1_DESC	Shepherd seems to have discovered what I'm up to. Surprisingly, he didn't stop me. In fact, sometimes I feel he's making things easy for me. I just can't figure that man out.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M2	Diary - 34
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M2_DESC	The cartel's militia screwed up again. Good thing my Shadow Company was there to clean up the mess. How can those guys not handle something this simple?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M3	Diary - 35
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M3_DESC	Today I went up north to tour the Nova 6 plant. Come on, Russians, did you have to build the plant somewhere this cold?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M4	Diary - 36
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_M4_DESC	Nova 6 development is going very smoothly. We're getting closer and closer.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H3	World Map
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H3_DESC	A map of humanity's last base.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H4	Circuit Diagram
COOP_STORY_INTEL_SUSPENSION_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M1	Diary - 37
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M1_DESC	Watched a Nova 6 test. Yes, that's exactly the effect I wanted.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M2	Diary - 38
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M2_DESC	Vazquez is complaining about me again. Damn it, if I hadn't been helping him these past few years, the regular army would have shot him full of holes long ago.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M3	Diary - 39
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M3_DESC	The cartel's militia finally stirred up trouble and actually clashed with the 141. Like throwing an egg at a rock. Damn it, a bunch of amateurs.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M4	Diary - 40
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_M4_DESC	One of the lieutenants was captured by the 141. Who knows how much he'll spill. Good thing only Vazquez knows about my business.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_H1	Model - Memory Chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_H1_DESC	A modified mech memory chip
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_H2	Computer - Scientist's Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_H2_DESC	The mechs started this war because their programming was altered... by whom?
