COOP_STORY_INTEL_BROTHER_H4_DESC	Technical instructions for shutting down all mechs at once.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E1	Computer - Workplace Injury Report
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E1_DESC	Since we started using mechs for dangerous work, there hasn't been a single workplace injury.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E2	Photo - Best Friends
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E2_DESC	A photo of a mech mother holding a young boy
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E3	Magazine - Mech Magazine Article
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E3_DESC	Over 1 billion mechs in use worldwide
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E4	Poster - A Mech for Everyone
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_E4_DESC	Buy a CT-102 Mech Servant - every home needs one!
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M1	Diary - 41
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M1_DESC	It couldn't stay under wraps forever. The 141 is on the move. Looks like Vazquez and his militia are done for. Should I help him out?
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M2	Diary - 42
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M2_DESC	Today Shepherd called us in for a briefing. Sure enough, the plan is pure 141 style.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M3	Diary - 43
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M3_DESC	After the meeting Shepherd kept Captain Price and me back and talked about some secret weapon. Damn it, he knows something about Nova 6.
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M4	Diary - 44
COOP_STORY_INTEL_PACKAGE_M4_DESC	Thought it over when I got back. Vazquez is still of some use to me, and I don't want the 141 learning any more about Nova 6. Fine, let my Shadow Company take on the 141.
