VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_01	^2Harker: ^7I'm Colonel Winston Harker.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_02	^2Harker: ^7On behalf of our great nation, welcome to Task Force 141.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_03	^2Harker: ^7I served with the 141 myself before moving up to command.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_04	^2Harker: ^7Every one of these men is highly skilled. Being chosen means you're no ordinary soldier either.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_05	^2Harker: ^7Next, you'll report to "the Pit."
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_06	^2Harker: ^7You've probably never heard of it, because no one outside knows it exists.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_PIT_07	^2Harker: ^7And now, neither do you.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7The Cortez Cartel is spreading across Juanito like a virus.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7We believe the cartel may be in league with the country's de facto ruler - General Alberto Vazquez.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Our informant, Ortiz, will put us in touch with the right people inside Vazquez's organization.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Given the right incentive, these people will say anything.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_05	^2Soap: ^7I'll dig into the Cortez Cartel's records and see what turns up.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Excellent.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_07	^2Price: ^7Rookie, you go with Ghost to meet Ortiz, then bring the informant back.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_INTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Simple errand, son - just right to warm you up.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_01	^2Soap: ^7Price, this is Soap.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_02	^2Soap: ^7Vazquez is the one who turned Ortiz.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_03	^2Soap: ^7Vazquez is dirtier than we thought.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_04	^2Soap: ^7For the past two months he's been supplying the Cortez Cartel with military-grade weapons.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_05	^2Ghost: ^7Vazquez got wind of it - the bastard's gone into hiding.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Vazquez harboring the Cortez Cartel and working hand in glove with them is not good news.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_07	^2Price: ^7Ortiz and the rookie are on the chopper.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Ortiz didn't give up much, but he did name a town called Oderan.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_09	^2Price: ^7It's not far from your position. That's where Vazquez is hiding.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_FAVELA_OUTRO_10	^2Price: ^7We need you to infiltrate his office and gather intel on his current location.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_CRASH_01	^2Price: ^7Vazquez is using Oderan as his temporary base of operations.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_CRASH_02	^2Price: ^7A UAV will provide you with aerial surveillance.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_CRASH_03	^2Price: ^7Infiltrate the town and head for Vazquez's office.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_CRASH_04	^2Price: ^7Find the intel and pin down his latest location and movements.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Vazquez had been working with the Cortez Cartel to ship unknown cargo out of the country.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7Counterfeit money? Weapons?
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Only Vazquez knows.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7We now know where he's hiding.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_INTRO_05	^2Price: ^7Get in there and take Vazquez alive!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7The mystery group that took out Vazquez was armed to the teeth.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7Clearly they don't want us to know what was shipped out of Juanito.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Vazquez was silenced, but the operation wasn't a total loss.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Intel recovered from the laptop reveals some disturbing information.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7What Vazquez and the Cortez Cartel shipped abroad was a chemical agent.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Called Element 115.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_07	^2Price: ^7This is bad.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Worse still, the shipment went to Bakar.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_09	^2Price: ^7When it rains, it pours.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_10	^2Price: ^7Command and the diplomats are trying to negotiate with the Bakar authorities.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_11	^2Price: ^7We'll see if we can track down Element 115 on the black market.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_12	^2Price: ^7Meanwhile, rookie, we're sending you to the chemical's delivery destination.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_ESTATE_OUTRO_13	^2Price: ^7You did well today - but your job is only getting started.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Bakar's diplomats claim they've never had any contact with Vazquez or the Cortez Cartel.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7They also say the plant that received Element 115 isn't inside Bakar's borders.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7It's in the demilitarized zone between the two countries.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Harker thinks there's no point pursuing this any further.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_05	^2Price: ^7Besides, going into the DMZ is bad PR.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_06	^2Price: ^7He thinks we should drop it. But command has ordered us to follow up.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_07	^2Price: ^7You'll be airdropped at the designated location.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_INTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Infiltrate the chemical plant and get to the bottom of this!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Ground comms show someone is giving orders to those mercenaries, but we can't tell who.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7For now, we don't know what they're doing there either.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7We're here now, so let's make the best of it.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Proceed as planned. I'll handle the brass.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7A UAV is en route to support you.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_EVASION_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Get into position and get ready to fight!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7No one can find Harker. He's vanished.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7We'll keep looking into why.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7In the meantime, your orders stand.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7The plant is heavily guarded and the mercs are well equipped.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_05	^2Price: ^7A UAV is inbound, so you'll have some air support.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_INTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Infiltrate the plant and find out exactly what Element 115 is for.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_OUTRO_01	^2Ghost: ^7Price, this is Ghost - I'm inside the plant.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_OUTRO_02	^2Ghost: ^7They're making chemical weapons here.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_OUTRO_03	^2Ghost: ^7These canisters are being moved to a warehouse on the other side of the base.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_OUTRO_04	^2Ghost: ^7Soap, take the rookie to the warehouse. I'll keep scouting over here.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_SNIPERFI_OUTRO_05	^2Soap: ^7You heard him - let's go.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Still no word from Harker.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7But we have an opportunity - looks like those mercs are regrouping.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Get to the warehouse now and uncover who's behind these chemical weapons.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7I've got news, and it's bad news.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7None of the mercs or workers know who hired them to work at the plant.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Clearly, the workers' job was to turn the Element 115 Vazquez smuggled in into a deadly gas called Nova 6.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Also, we can't be certain the man in the footage is Harker.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7It makes no sense. But I trust my own eyes.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7One thing's for sure: these mercs are equipped as well as we are, and they show no mercy to their own.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_STORM_OUTRO_07	^2Price: ^7Once someone like Vazquez outlives his usefulness, they kill him without hesitation...
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Listen up - command considers the WMDs there extremely dangerous.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7They're dropping a MOAB to clear the area.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Which means we need to get you out of there fast.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Ghost, return to the squad and link up with Soap and the rookie at the LZ!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_INTRO_05	^2Price: ^7I've sent an AC130 to cover your extraction. Move!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7The intel you gathered shows almost every Nova 6 canister has been accounted for... 
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7...except one.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7According to the intel, that Nova 6 canister was shipped to Pantar.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7That's right... Bakar's sworn enemy.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7The two countries are already on the brink of war.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Once Nova 6 is deployed on Pantar soil, the conflict will escalate and the whole region will suffer.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_07	^2Price: ^7Which is exactly what someone has been planning all along.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Maybe it's one of Bakar's enemies; or maybe the people who hit us in Juanito are behind it.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_09	^2Price: ^7But we don't have time to track down who's pulling the strings.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_AC130_OUTRO_10	^2Price: ^7Our top priority is to find the missing Nova 6 and disarm it before it goes off.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Thanks to your intel, we found a unique signal signature that lets us track the missing Nova 6.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7We now know where the Nova 6 is - it's crossing a bridge into the city.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Get to the bridge now and end this!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7We're still tracking the Nova 6 signal. Don't lose it!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7At least now we know who the enemy is. They must be the ones who turned Harker.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7We'd heard rumors of a well-funded, well-armed extremist group code-named "Shadow Company."
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Now it looks like they're finally making their move.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BRIDGE_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7Keep tracking the Nova 6 - we have to take down Harker and all his men!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Harker has moved the bomb into the city, and his men are prepping it for detonation.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_INTRO_02	^2Price: ^7If that bomb goes off, the civilian casualties will be beyond counting.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_INTRO_03	^2Price: ^7You have to get there before Harker's men detonate the Nova 6.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_INTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Move out now and take down Harker!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Nice work, son.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7But Harker is massing a heavy counterattack on your position.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7Check your weapons and ammo, and get ready!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_BIGBROTHER_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7You must protect Soap and the Nova 6 at all costs!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_01	^2Price: ^7Ghost, Soap, rookie - Harker is sending reinforcements your way - get ready.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_02	^1Harker: ^7Give it up, gentlemen. Resistance is futile. You'll all die here.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_03	^1Harker: ^7What chance do they have? How many have you got?
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_04	^1Harker: ^7I know your tactics. I wrote the book.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_05	^1Harker: ^7Just surrender, old friend. Shadow Company will - 
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_06	^2Price: ^7Harker! Stand down now! Or don't blame me for what happens!
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_07	^2Price: ^7This fight could go either way. We have to be ready.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_08	^2Price: ^7Set up your defenses and guard the Nova 6.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_INTRO_09	^2Price: ^7And if you get the chance - take out that scumbag.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_01	^2Price: ^7The problem is, if Shadow Company can get its hands into everything like this
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_02	^2Price: ^7then no one can say where this goes next.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_03	^2Price: ^7For now, Shadow Company has scattered.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_04	^2Price: ^7Probably fled back to their underground lair.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_05	^2Price: ^7But one day, we'll find that lair.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_06	^2Price: ^7And when we do, not one of them will get away.
VIDSUBTITLES_SPOV_LASTSTAND_OUTRO_07	^2Price: ^7And when we do, they'll pay in blood...
