MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME01	Welcome to Boot Camp, soldier!
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME02	In the live-fire training ahead, follow the instructions and complete as many training tasks as you can.
MP_TUTORIAL_S1_KILL3PRI	Kill 3 enemies with your primary weapon
MP_TUTORIAL_S1_KILL2SEC	Kill 2 enemies with your secondary weapon
MP_TUTORIAL_S2_RELOAD	Press ^3[{+reload}]^7 to reload your weapon
MP_TUTORIAL_S2_KILL2MEL	Kill an enemy with a melee attack
MP_TUTORIAL_S2_USELET	Press ^3[{+frag}]^7 to throw a frag grenade
MP_TUTORIAL_S2_KILL3ADS	Kill 3 enemies while aiming down the sight
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL3CRO	Kill 3 enemies while crouched
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_PICKWEP	Pick up a weapon dropped by an enemy
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_USE1UAV	Press ^3[{+actionslot 2}]^7 to use a UAV.\nEarn it with 3 kills in a row.
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL1LET	Kill an enemy with a grenade
MP_TUTORIAL_END01	Congratulations, you've completed all training tasks!
MP_TUTORIAL_END02	Keep sharpening your combat skills in upcoming matches!
SUBTITLE_TFANCR_UK_1MC_USE_AIRSTRIKE	Ally airstrike
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME03	Before training begins, there are some basics you need to know.
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME04	In combat, when your crosshair is on an enemy, his name is shown in red:
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME05	If you're aiming at a teammate, his name is shown in green:
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME06	Also, always keep an eye on the minimap in the top left corner of the screen.
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME07	Enemies who are firing or spotted by a UAV are marked as red dots.
MP_TUTORIAL_S0_WELCOME08	You and your teammates are shown as arrows.
MP_TUTORIAL_S1_MINIMAP	Check the minimap in the upper left corner
MP_TUTORIAL_S2_START01	The enemies will start moving now
MP_TUTORIAL_PREPARE	Get ready!
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_START01	Now for the real test. The enemies will shoot back.
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_START02	I've sent a few teammates to support you.
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_START03	Complete as many challenges as you can.
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL5PRI	Kill 5 enemies with your primary weapon
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL5ADS	Press ^3[{+toggleads_throw}]^7 to aim down sights and kill 5 enemies
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL5SEC	Press ^3[{weapnext}]^7 to use your secondary weapon and kill 5 enemies
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_EARNUAV	Earn a UAV
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_KILL5MEL	Press ^3[{+melee}]^7 to kill 5 enemies with melee attacks
MP_TUTORIAL_S3_USE3UAV	Use ^3[{+actionslot 2}]^7 to call in 3 UAVs.\nEach takes 3 kills in a row.
